        {
          "text": "(Pele ibbokesi lya-Leza, Davida kaliletede kuzwa ku-Kiriati-Jearimu akulisisya kubusena Davida mbwaakalibambila, nkaambo wakalibambila cilao mu-Jerusalemu). ",
          "type": "text",
