          "text": "Nkabela Solomoni wakalivuzizya inkalaki abasimbizi, Kajisi inkalaki zili cuulu amyanda yone, abasimbizi bali zyuulu zili ikumi azibili mbaakabika muminzi yacisi ca-Israyeli akumwami ku-Jerusalemu. ",
